    "description" : "<p style='font-size:12px; color:#333333;'><u>Banned objects:</u></p>Sanctuary, Hill Fort, Cartograhper, Cover of Darkness.<p style='font-size:12px; color:#333333;'><u>Modified objects:</u></p>1) <b>Warrior's Tomb</b> - Tome of Air Magic, Tome of Earth Magic, Spellbinder's Hat, Angel Wings, Helm of Heavenly Enlightenment and Sword of Judgements cannot be obtained.<br>2) <b>Scholar</b> - only t1 - t3 spells can be obtained.<br>3) <b>Swan Pond</b> - takes only 500 movement points.<br>4) <b>Fountain of Fortune</b> - gives +1, +2 or +3 Luck for the next battle (60, 30 and 10% chance, respectively).<br> 5) <b>Stables</b> - gies 300 movement points bonus until the end of the week. The change applies also to Stables building in Castle.<br>6) <b>Spell Scrolls</b> with t4 and t5 spells - value changed to 8k and 10k, respectively. Scrolls containing Dimension Door and Fly are of 20k value.<br>7) Adjusted value of: Imp Cache, Trading Post, Obelisk Freelancer's Guild and Shrines of Magic.<br>",

